(Question 01: What has influenced your decision to pursue a career in medicine?) Tj
T*
(Category: Personal and Motivation) Tj
T*
(Structure:) Tj
T*
(Start: Give a direct reason, then name the experience or value that made it real.) Tj
T*
(Middle: Explain one or two specific experiences and what they taught you about medicine.) Tj
T*
(End: Link the reflection to patient care, long-term commitment and realistic) Tj
T*
(preparation.) Tj
T*
(Mark Scheme:) Tj
T*
(General:) Tj
T*
